<section class="page-section"><h2>How to Begin</h2><div class="info-grid"><article class="info-card"><h3>$0 Signup Fee</h3><p>No signup fee.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>$0 Monthly Affiliate Fee</h3><p>You are not charged monthly just to use the affiliate system.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>SOL Commission Ledger</h3><p>Eligible commissions are calculated in SOL using the verified payment quote rate.</p></article></div><div class="actions"><a class="gold-cta" href="/auth/google?role=affiliate">JOIN WITH GOOGLE</a><a class="dark-cta" href="/login">ACCOUNT OPTIONS</a></div></section>
